{"skill":{"slug":"akshare-finance","displayName":"Akshare Finance"},"version":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1772204869129,"changelog":"akshare-finance 1.0.0\n\n- 首次发布，基于AKShare接口库封装财经数据查询功能\n- 支持获取股票、期货、期权、基金、外汇、债券、指数、加密货币等金融产品的基本面及行情数据\n- 提供宏观经济指标、财务数据、市场概览与投资组合监控示例\n- 默认返回Pandas DataFrame，便于数据处理与分析\n- 简要说明安装方法和常见用法","changelogSource":"auto","license":null,"files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":3204,"sha256":"641f1bbeeaa7f1176659f6b7d0d6d0a626a0942eff3bf2d38bf15b8f63683412","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/README.md","size":1335,"sha256":"8d62e9e62ece17349cbfb021df71d0683bd6c9f47acbdffc0d5ffa9aa0f81f75","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"scripts/crypto_price.py","size":2385,"sha256":"b7795a706c98dae91911893c76b2ae09fa28637dcdb6aeebd43c0aa29b883676","contentType":"text/plain"},{"path":"scripts/macro_data.py","size":1903,"sha256":"8976d98694b88a0a24b2be55c4c4edff37168cb7152ca320812b7ea63702530b","contentType":"text/plain"},{"path":"scripts/stock_price.py","size":1872,"sha256":"83be6ce44e5aace7b9bff9a76bc753f9cd655abc45f34b370f5a7ecaba3df6bf","contentType":"text/plain"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2531,"sha256":"3d35b4a919a6636853fd75c5af15ddff62bc31e502fedbfbc65a00588180246b","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789089503918,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"3e02d5de3178cb31301e11397936436c683198f08583c0cf52c31a8e87e10790","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/3e02d5de3178cb31301e11397936436c683198f08583c0cf52c31a8e87e10790","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":"Type: OpenClaw Skill\nName: akshare-finance\nVersion: 1.0.0\n\nThe OpenClaw AgentSkills bundle 'akshare-finance' is designed to provide financial data using the legitimate AKShare library. All Python scripts (`crypto_price.py`, `macro_data.py`, `stock_price.py`) correctly import and utilize `akshare` and `pandas` to fetch and process public financial data, outputting results in JSON format. The `SKILL.md` documentation specifies standard dependencies and provides benign usage examples, with no evidence of prompt injection attempts or instructions for the AI agent to perform unauthorized actions. There are no signs of data exfiltration, malicious execution, persistence mechanisms, or obfuscation. The skill's behavior is entirely aligned with its stated purpose.","source":"palm","checkedAt":1779167700618},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":28,"severity":"MEDIUM","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":9,"checkedAt":1789089503918},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This skill is a straightforward AKShare financial data helper that fetches public market data, with dependency and localization caveats but no hidden or destructive behavior found.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Outbound network access to public financial data providers is inherent to live market and macroeconomic data retrieval and is broadly disclosed by the skill's purpose and data-source notes.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The skill installs third-party Python packages akshare and pandas with minimum or unpinned versions, which is common for this kind of integration but means users should prefer an isolated environment and reviewed pinned versions for sensitive workflows.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"note"},{"detail":"Instructions and examples are user-directed and finance-focused; documentation and script messages are Chinese-only, which is a usability/localization limitation rather than evidence of unsafe agent behavior.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"note"},{"detail":"No persistence, privilege escalation, background services, tool hijacking, credential access, or automatic destructive file changes were found; the only file-write example is a user-directed CSV export snippet.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The artifacts coherently implement the stated purpose: wrapping AKShare calls for stock, crypto, and China macroeconomic data, returning JSON or Pandas examples without trading, account access, credential use, or private-data handling.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Install this in a virtual environment, understand that it queries external financial-data services, and consider pinning akshare and pandas versions if you need reproducible or higher-assurance use. Treat outputs as market-data assistance, not investment advice.","findings":"[SQP-3] expected: The Chinese-only documentation and output labels were verified, but they align with the AKShare and China-market focus and do not create a security concern on their own.\n[SQP-2] expected: The scripts call AKShare functions that fetch external market data; this is expected for a financial data skill, though clearer runtime disclosure would improve transparency.\n[T08] expected: The dependency installation concern is valid hygiene advice because versions are not locked or hash-verified, but the named dependencies are purpose-aligned and there is no artifact evidence of malicious dependency use.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789089503918}}}}}